# The Holy Crest (battlefield.holy_crest, Ghelsba Outpost): a level 30 Dragoon with the quest accepted and the
# Dragon Curse Remedy triggers Hut_Door. Updates 0 (ignored), 4 (index 0, not in the menu: REQS_NOT_MET), 16
# (registered: the area is fixed at 1), 20 and 17 (already registered). A tick spawns Cyranuce M Cutauleon; killed: the
# win, event 32001, its finish, the cleanup.
lists GhelsbaOutpost/Hut_Door/onTrigger GhelsbaOutpost/onEventUpdate/32000 GhelsbaOutpost/onEventFinish/32000 GhelsbaOutpost/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=GhelsbaOutpost pos=-163.5,-11.7,77.8 job=DRG lvl=30
quest Sandoria.TheHolyCrest accepted
keyitem DragonCurseRemedy
login
trigger Hut_Door
update 32000 option=0
update 32000 option=4
update 32000 option=16
update 32000 option=20
update 32000 option=17
finish
tick 2000
kill CYRANUCE_M_CUTAULEON
finish
tick 11000
tick 10000
